sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant App as Existing Expo App
    participant API as Express Server
    participant DB as MongoDB
    Customer->>App: Confirm order
    App->>API: POST /api/orders (Bearer JWT, IDs, quantities)
    API->>API: Authenticate customer
    API->>DB: Load MenuItems and table
    DB-->>API: Current prices and availability
    API->>API: Validate and calculate authoritative total
    API->>DB: Insert Pending order with price snapshots
    DB-->>API: Saved order
    API-->>App: 201 order and server total
    App->>App: Clear cart only after success
    App-->>Customer: Confirmation
    loop Every exactly 10 seconds
        App->>API: GET /api/orders/my
        API->>DB: Query own orders
        DB-->>API: Latest manager-controlled status
        API-->>App: 200 order list
    end
